    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>**This game is no longer being supported by updates, but it's now free to play!</strong>**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Murmur in the Trees is a short, mystery adventure set in the woods of prohibition-era America. Play as a reporter sent into the mysterious woods of Lonesome Falls. A local woman claims to have information about the recent 'Moonshine Murders', but you'll have to find her to hear what she knows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Details:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Explore the mysterious forest of Lonesome Falls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Solve simple puzzles to progress the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Interact with residents of the area through branching dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Make decisions with consequences. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>**This game is no longer being supported by updates, but it's now free to play!</strong>**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Murmur in the Trees is a short, mystery adventure set in the woods of prohibition-era America. Play as a reporter sent into the mysterious woods of Lonesome Falls. A local woman claims to have information about the recent 'Moonshine Murders', but you'll have to find her to hear what she knows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Details:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Explore the mysterious forest of Lonesome Falls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Solve simple puzzles to progress the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Interact with residents of the area through branching dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Make decisions with consequences. </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A Murmur in the Trees is a short adventure mystery in prohibition-era America. Explore the forest on your quest to unravel the mystery of the Moonshine Murders.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cThere\u2019s a nice mixture of exploration, puzzle solving, stealth and action as you make your investigation. The environment is beautiful, the writing is witty and there are a few surprises along the way.\u201d<br>Alpha Beta Gamer<br>",
